<title>USA: Northrop gets Boeing contract.</title>
<headline>Northrop gets Boeing contract.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northrop Grumman Corp said Monday it has received a contract from Boeing Co worth over $200 million.</p>
<p>Northrop said in a statement the contract, which extends into the next century, is for the production of nacelle components for Boeing 747, 757, 767 and 777 airplanes.</p>
<p>The new work includes fan cowl assemblies, composite thrust reverser and inlet panels and other composite components.</p>
